{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-toledo","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"toledo-bloom-holding-zayed-city","about":"Toledo by Bloom Properties is an amazing residential development of 2-5 bedroom villas and townhouses located in Zayed City, Abu Dhabi. This is the second phase of the massive Bloom Living project.The Toledo villas and townhouses reflect the beauty of the ancient Spanish city. Multicoloured mosaics, intricate patterns of geometric figures and calligraphy, low buildings not higher than 2 floors, abundance of greenery - all this fills the residential complex with a unique atmosphere of the Mediterranean.Residents have the opportunity to admire the green landscape from the terraces located on the ground floors of all houses. Panoramic windows, high ceilings, balconies, master bedrooms with en-suite bathrooms and dressing rooms, two-car garage with entrance to the house - every detail is designed to enjoy a country lifestyle.Residents will enjoy swimming pools with panoramic views, quiet park areas, yoga and barbecue areas, as well as children's and sports grounds. For business travellers there are conference rooms for events, and for leisure there are cafes, restaurants and shops.Toledo is located in Abu Dhabi's Zayed City neighbourhood, just one minute by car from Swayhan Road and five minutes from Sheikh Maktoum Bin Rashid Road. Residents will have quick access to Abu Dhabi city centre, Yas Island and other business, shopping and tourist centres.","price":3615000,"title":"Toledo","bitrix":{"id":942,"pf_id":"are.3.13089","source":null,"project_id":"Zayed City (Khalifa City C)","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Toledo","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Bloom Holding","project_location":"Khalifa City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2805/images/2024/08/13/340x252/IDvOlb5SmNjtZPW8JaMbEi0iqMUTeU9iA9CjGbgd.webp","464